Description: A dashboard for Q-sort analysis, built at the Center
    for Alaska Native Health Research (CANHR), University of Alaska
    Fairbanks.
    Imports sorts from CSV, Excel, PQMethod, HTMLQ, FlashQ, and Ken-Q
    files; ranks statement priorities, with demographic subgroup
    comparisons and a rank-flow chart; runs the classical factor
    analysis (extraction, rotation, flagging, bootstrap stability) and a
    Bayesian analysis through the 'bayesqm' engine; and exports the
    figures and complete results as Excel files.
